:: Bailey Offer Yourself
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<if $stockholm_points is undefined>><<set $stockholm_points to {}>><</if>>
<<set $bailey_offered to ($bailey_offered || 0)>>

<<if ($speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy")>>
	"I-I have the money," you say quietly. You hold it out, then pull it back slightly. "But I could... go. If you wanted. I-I'll be back."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I have your money," you say, holding the money out. "But you can send me. I'll just be right back, anyway."
<<else>>
	"I have the money," you say, holding the money out. "But I'll go willingly, if that's worth more to you."
<</if>>
<br><br>

/* MONEY DEDUCTION POLICY
   Always guard with `<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>` before
   `<<set $money -= ...>>`. The vanilla <<money>> macro crashes if PC can't
   afford the amount, and a broke PC can reach this scene (e.g. the street
   ambush), so we deduct with a plain <<set>> behind the guard. The
   ($babyRent || 0) part makes sure PCs with babies don't get babyRent waived
   for free. */

<<if $bailey_offered is undefined or $bailey_offered is 0>>
	<<if $baileydefeated gte 5>>
		Bailey goes very still. <<He>> frowns deeply, <<his>> eyes moving over your face.
		<br><br>

		"Finally," <<he>> sneers. "All that fighting. All that fuss." <<He>> takes the money from you.<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><<set $money -= $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><</if>> "What a waste of time. At least you're finally doing what you're told."
		<br><br>

		<<He>> produces a hood and rope from behind <<his>> back.
		<br><br>

		"Fine, you little shit. Let's see how you do."<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<set $bailey_dom += 3>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $bailey_love += 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">><<set $stockholm_bailey += 3>><<set $stockholm_points.offer to true>><<set $stockholm_points.offer_defeat to true>><<gbaileystock>>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Bailey goes very still. <<His>> eyes move over your face, evaluating it for something. The corner of <<his>> mouth twitches into a smirk.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> takes the money from you.<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><<set $money -= $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><</if>> Then <<he>> produces a hood and rope from behind <<his>> back.
		<br><br>

		"Don't make me regret this."<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<set $bailey_dom += 3>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $bailey_love += 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">><<set $stockholm_bailey += 1>><<set $stockholm_points.offer to true>><<gbaileystock>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	/* Don't bump $bailey_offered here. That happens later in Bailey Offer Walk, after the first-visit prose. */
<<else>>
	/* Stockholm activation: PC's 2nd-or-later offer while holding 3+ Stockholm points. */
	<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 3 and $stockholm_active isnot true>>
		<<set $bailey_offered += 1>>
		<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
			<<set $money -= $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal to $baileyRefusedToPayTotal lt $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0) ? 0 : $baileyRefusedToPayTotal - ($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))>>
		<<unset $bailey_encroach>>

		<<He>> takes the money from your hand and counts it slower than usual. <<He>> folds it into <<his>> coat.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> doesn't produce a hood and rope this time. <<His>> hand closes around your arm. <<He>> steers you down the hallway, past the other doors, past the kitchen, into <<his>> office.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> shuts and locks the door behind <<him>>.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Bailey Stockholm Reveal]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		/* Repeat-offer path. Handle money the way the policy at the top of this passage describes. */
		<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
			<<set $money -= $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $bailey_offered gte 4>>
			Bailey tosses you a hood. <<He>>'s smiling at you.
			<br><br>

			"You know the way."
		<<elseif $bailey_offered gte 3>>
			The hood is already in <<his>> hand. <<He>> holds it out to you.
			<br><br>

			You take it. The last thing you see before you put the hood on is Bailey's smirk.
		<<else>>
			Bailey lets out a light exhale. <<He>> pulls out a hood and ropes from seemingly nowhere.
			<br><br>

			"Let's go, then."<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<set $bailey_offered += 1>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $stockholm_bailey lt 3 or $stockholm_active is true or $bailey_offered lte 1>>
	<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>>
	<<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>>
	<<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal to $baileyRefusedToPayTotal lt $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0) ? 0 : $baileyRefusedToPayTotal - ($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))>>
	<<unset $bailey_encroach>>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen and $bailey_offered_seen.manor and $bailey_offered_seen.eden and $bailey_offered_seen.remy and $bailey_offered_seen.underground and setup.inflation.canAfford(300000, "baileyBuyerChoice")>>
		<<link [[Ask to choose where you're sent (<<printprice 300000>>)|Bailey Choose Buyer Ask]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Offer Walk
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<set $soldCount += 1>>
<<set $bailey_offered_seen to ($bailey_offered_seen || {})>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

/* Force phase to 0 so Robin isn't sold alongside PC. */
<<set $phase to 0>>

/* Two counters. $bailey_offered = total times you've offered (drives the hood/binding
   prose). $bailey_offered_seen = which places you've already been sent (.remy, .eden...),
   for the "you've been here before" lines. Separate so each place tracks its own first visit. */

<<if $bailey_offered gte 3>>
	You pull the hood over your own head. Bailey binds your arms behind your back, loosely. You know the route by now. Down the stairs, along the tunnel. Bailey walks beside you.
<<elseif $bailey_offered gte 2>>
	With the hood over your head and your arms bound behind your back, you are led down the stairs and along the tunnel. Bailey's hand rests on your shoulder, guiding you down the tunnel.
<<else>>
	With your head covered by a hood and your arms bound behind your back, you are led down a flight of stairs and along a tunnel. Bailey's grip on your arm is firm but steady. You manage not to trip despite the brutal pace Bailey set.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<pass 20>>

<<if $rentsale is 3>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.underground>>
		Bailey walks you down the corridor.
		<br><br>
		"Underground brothel," <<he>> says, like <<he>>'s reading from a list. "You'll be there a while. Keep your head down and find a way out."
	<<else>>
		Bailey leads you down the corridor. <<His>> pace is slower than usual.
		<br><br>
		"The underground brothel," <<he>> spits out. "Escape when you can. <span class="bailey-red">Come back to me.</span>"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 2>>
	<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1 and ($avery_fate is "saved" or $avery_fate is "fallen" or $avery_fate is "kicked")>>
		Bailey stops walking. You feel <<his>> hand tracing along your collar.
		<br><br>
		"Change of plans," <<he>> says. "Someone paid more." <<He>> pauses. "Be careful with the shopkeep. You're in over your head."
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $bailey_offered_seen.remy>>
		"Remy's farm," <<he>> says while <<he>> walks you. "You've been there. You know what they do."
	<<else>>
		Bailey is quiet for a long time. You can tell <<he>>'s angry, even though you can't see <<him>>.
		<br><br>
		"You'll be taken to a farm," <<he>> says. "Try to stay in one piece."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 1>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.eden>>
		"Eden," Bailey says to you. "Enjoy your time playing house. I'll see you when you come home."
	<<else>>
		"Someone in the forest wants company," Bailey says to you. You can hear something stiff in <<his>> tone. "You'll manage."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<else>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.manor>>
		"Watch the dogs," <<he>> says. "I'll see you when you're home."
	<<else>>
		"Dinner party," <<he>> says. "You're on the menu."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $rentsale is 3>>
	<<set $rentsale to 0>><<generate2>><<person2>>
	After journeying for some time you hear another set of footsteps. "Hand <<phim>> over," says a <<personssimple>> voice.
	<br><br>

	"Money first," responds Bailey. "Will I get <<phim>> back?"
	<br><br>

	"You won't want <<phim>> when we're done."
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.underground>>
		<br><br><<person1>>
		Bailey exhales once through <<his>> nose. <span class="bailey-red">"I wouldn't bet on that."</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You hear a rustle of paper before being dragged further along the tunnel.
	<br><br>

	<<badEndTracking "Underground Dungeon" { reason: "soldBailey" }>>
	<<link [[Next|Underground Intro]]>><<set $baileySold to true>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.underground to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 2>>
	<<set $rentsale += 1>>
	<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1 and ($avery_fate is "saved" or $avery_fate is "fallen" or $avery_fate is "kicked")>>
		You journey until you hear wind rustling through leaves.<br><br>
		"The witch made arrangements," Bailey starts as <<he>> lifts you and hooks your bindings on something behind you, leaving you suspended in the air.
		<br><br>
		You feel <<his>> hands run along your collar. "Lucky you."
		<br><br>
		You hear <<him>> walk away, leaving you alone.
		<br><br>

		<<set $bailey_offered_seen.remy to true>>
		<<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>>
		<<endevent>>
		<<rentGwylanTrade>>
	<<else>>
		<<leash 21>>
		You journey until you hear the sound of engines up ahead. The sound echoes, becoming closer, until you hear it all around you.
		"Good stock," says an unfamiliar voice. "Would make a fine breeder."
		<br><br>
		"The money," Bailey responds, impatient.
		<br><br>
		"Ah. Here." There's a rustle to one side, then someone tugs on your leash, pulling you forward.
		<br><br>
		"A pleasure," Bailey says, already walking away.
		<br><br>

		"Watch the step," says the unfamiliar voice. Whatever you've stepped onto is rumbling. "Sit."
		You fumble around your knees, and find what feels like a bench.
		You sit, then hear the slam of doors, and a few moments later you lurch as the floor moves beneath you. You're in a vehicle.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Street Van Bailey]]>><<set $baileySold to true>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.remy to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

<<elseif $rentsale is 1>>
	<<set $rentsale += 1>>
	You journey for some time until you hear birdsong, and the crunch of earth beneath your feet. A door creaks. Bailey pushes you forward, and you hear the door close and lock behind you.
	<br><br>

	<<set $bailey_offered_seen.eden to true>>
	<<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<rentEdenTrade>>

<<else>>
	<<set $rentsale to 1>>
	<<generate2>><<person2>>
	After journeying for some time you hear another set of footsteps. "This is the merchandise?" says a <<personssimple>> voice.
	<br><br>

	"No, I'm just taking my <<girl>> for a walk," says Bailey, <<person1>><<nnpc_his "Bailey">> temper barely concealed beneath the sarcasm. "Just give me the cash."
	<br><br>

	A moment later, you feel someone press something against your mouth, and your consciousness fades.<<arousal 6000>><<gggarousal>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Danube Meal]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.manor to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Choose Buyer Ask
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude is "shy">>
	"Uhm... May I choose where I am sent?" you ask, avoiding <<his>> gaze. "I'll pay."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Let me choose where I get sent," you say, looking right at <<him>>. "I got the cash."
<<else>>
	"Can I choose where I get sent?" you ask, looking at the hood and ropes. "I can pay."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey regards you for a moment and shrugs.
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_dom lt 30>>
	"You go where I sell you," Bailey says with a sneer. "You volunteered for this, brat. Let's go."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	"Fine," <<he>> says. "Pay up. <span class="gold"><<printprice 300000>></span>."
	<br><br>

	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(300000, "baileyBuyerChoice")>><<money -300000 "baileyBuyerChoice">><</if>>
	You hand <<him>> the money.
	<br><br>

	"You know your usual buyers," Bailey nods after squaring your money away. "I'll let you choose, since I'm feeling generous."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[The Manor|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Eden's cabin|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Remy's farm|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[The Underground Brothel|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
